Step 2 is done: I added the CSV exporter in `src/widget-export.js`. It has small pure functions (`escapeField`, `toRow`, `exportWidgetsToCsv`), a header row, and RFC 4180 quoting with CRLF line endings. It writes only the `id` and `name` columns, with no JSON, per the plan's CSV-first decision.
I didn't run tests, commit, or start step 3, and I left the plan checkbox unchecked for checkpointing.
The repo had no existing code or language convention, so I chose CommonJS JavaScript. Tell me if you want a different language.
